lt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5922\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2227.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2227-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2227-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2227-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2227-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2227-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Inside the gift shop we sell hatchery merchandise and LOTS of fish food!<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2225.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5936\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2225.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2225-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2225-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2225-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2225-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2225-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>The &#8220;Pond Gift Shop&#8221; and restrooms with Pond #1 at the left<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>There are 10 RV sites in &#8220;Volunteer Village&#8221; which is a separate area of the beautiful Spearfish City Campground that is dedicated to use by volunteers at D.C. Booth Hatchery.  We are supplied the Full Hookup site, 45 channel cable, free wi-fi and a community fire pit area where we often gather each night for a campfire with smores and stories.  Sometimes we have pot luck meals there too!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2217.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5949\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2217.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2217-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2217-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2217-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2217-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/IMG_2217-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Our sites back up to Spearfish Creek and a walking trail<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190615_194330-2.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>Boys having fun floating down Spearfish Creek right behind our rigs<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>\n\nRemember, you can click on any of the thumbnails below to see an enlarged image\n\n<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_190440-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5950\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5950\" class=\"wp-image-5950\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_190440-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_190