 class=\"wp-image-5986\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_184000-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_184000-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_184000-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_184000-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_184000-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_184000.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_183912-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5985\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5985\" class=\"wp-image-5985\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_183912-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_183912-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_183912-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_183912-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_183912-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190612_183912.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_210458-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5984\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5984\" class=\"wp-image-5984\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_210458-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_210458-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_210458-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_210458-1-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_210458-1-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190606_210458-1.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Another special perk of this position is that the volunteers all get a &#8220;VIP&#8221; card to carry in their wallet.  This card is issued by the Black Hills &amp; Badlands Tourism Association and it entitles us to free admission to about 40 area attractions and discounts in area gift shops and restaurants.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The idea is that as tour guides at D.C. Booth we have the opportunity to meet and interact with hundreds of visitors daily and we should take the opportunity to talk with them about other attractions in the area.  We&#8217;re kind of a &#8220;mini marketing&#8221; team for other things to see and do nearby.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190623_091315-1.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5991\"\/><figcaption>This is the list of all the attractions free to tourism VIP&#8217;s<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Some of these benefits are valued at just a few dollars while others are over $100 per ticket.  It&#8217;s a great idea to promote the are wonderful benefit for us too!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>While we are here at Spearfish (through Sept 2019) I&#8217;ll be writing other short blog posts about our excursion trips that we take using the VIP cards so you can get a better feel for a lot of what there is to offer here in the beautiful Black Hills!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you think you might be interested in volunteering at D.C. Booth Historic Fish Hatchery and Archives, visit their web site at <a href=\"https:\/\/dcboothfishhatchery.org\/volunteer-programs\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\" (opens in a new tab)\">https:\/\/dcboothfishhatchery.org\/volunteer-programs\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re not already subscribed to this blog, you can easily do so by scrolling up to the top of any page and entering your email address in the block on the right side.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also subscribe to our YouTube channel (<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/results?search_query=herbnkathyrv\" target=\"_blank\">herbnkathyrv<\/a>) on You Tube.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re curious (at any time) to know where we are at that moment then click the button at the top right of this page labeled \u201c<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"http:\/\/aprs.link\/app\/aprs\/stations\/googlemap-WB8BHK-9\" target=\"_blank\">See Where We Are Now<\/a>\u201c.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We\u2019d love to hear from you. If you scroll all the way down to the bottom of this page, you can send us a note. Again, thanks for riding along. \u2019til next time \u2013 safe travels.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Our experience volunteering at D.C. Booth Historic Fish Hatchery &#038; Archives in Spearfish (Black Hills) S. Dakota <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":5918,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,586,677,264,19546,554707329,554707760,30025],"tags":[554707764,554707765,554707766,554707761,5995,554707768,1092413,18086,554707769,23317,554707767,554707696,554707770,554707306,554707763,554707762,554707357],"class_list":["post-5916","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-camping","category-food","category-friends","category-learning","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","category-volunteering","category-working","tag-badlands","tag-black-hills","tag-booth-house","tag-dc-booth","tag-fish","tag-fish-car","tag-hatchery","tag-lake","tag-messenger","tag-museum","tag-rail-car","tag-south-dakota","tag-spearfish","tag-stream","tag-teaching","tag-tourism","tag-trout"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5916","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5916"}],"version-history":[{"count":12,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5916\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5997,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5916\/revisions\/5997"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5918"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5916"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5916"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5916"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}